# My Role

I worked on implementing core features required to make MeetMate function as an interactive meeting participant.

My primary contributions were:

- Implementing two-way audio interaction.
- Injecting generated audio back into the active Google Meet session.
- Building the meeting-data RAG pipeline.
- Implementing data extraction and chunking.
- Generating and storing embeddings in ChromaDB.
- Implementing retrieval of relevant meeting context.
- Developing Flask endpoints for text-to-speech functionality.
- Integrating generated audio with the Playwright-controlled Chrome session.
- Implementing trigger-word based interaction.
- Supporting contextual responses using meeting information accumulated so far.
- Supporting the end-of-meeting summary workflow.

